		"excerpt": "In 2009, Google began work on a new network protocol to make web pages faster. Dubbed SPDY (pronounced \"speedy\"), the protocol is designed to solve many of the bottlenecks that slow HTTP down. Beginning today, we're rolling out a beta of SPDY to CloudFlare customers. ",
